kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "studio-slides-workflow"
purpose: 定义 SLIDES 的端到端工作流：draft 单一事实源、outline/markdown SSE、保存同步与预览链路。该规范用于保证断线重连、重试与预览刷新时的状态一致性。
valid_scope[2]: src/,tests/
requirements[13]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r53,"Slides are draft-centric across three stages",slides MUST 围绕 draft 运行 input/outline/markdown 三阶段并可恢复。
  r111,Draft API contract is stable,draft CRUD、outline 保存、markdown 保存端点 MUST 保持稳定；当 slides workflow capability 不可用时，这些端点 MUST 返回稳定且可执行的 unavailable 诊断，而不是假设 slides 默认可用。
  r148,"SSE endpoints and events are stable","outline/markdown stream MUST 通过 SSE 端点流式返回，使用稳定事件集合 `progress/toolcall/done/busy/error`；MUST NOT 返回同步 JSON。"
  r183,"Busy and stale-running handling is explicit","draft `running` 时 MUST 防并发重复（返回 busy 事件而非覆盖）；stale running（超过阈值，默认 10min，可配置）MUST 先清理再继续；清理 MUST 将 status 置为 IDLE、清空 errorMessage（置 null）并返回 bool，MUST NOT 写入非空诊断文案。"
  r215,Markdown generation requires existing outline,未有 outline 时 markdown stream MUST 返回可读错误并结束连接。
  r242,Successful generation persists draft before done,生成成功 MUST 先持久化 draft（含 chunkIds/stage/status），再发 `done`。
  r9,Preview always uses latest saved markdown,预览前端流程 MUST 先保存 markdown，再刷新当前 active slides workflow plugin 声明的预览目标；宿主与客户端 MUST NOT 硬编码 Slidev 作为唯一预览实现。
  r272,Slides UI availability follows tools contract,Studio slides 相关 UI（工具卡片、dialog、入口动作）MUST 以 `/v2/workspace/tools` 返回的 `SLIDES` tool 作为可用性唯一来源，不得依赖硬编码假设 slides 默认存在。
  "studio-latest-draft",Studio MUST provide drafts/latest endpoint,studio MUST 提供 GET 端点返回 notebook 下按 updatedAt desc 的最新 draft，MUST NOT 缺失该端点
  "studio-serialize-must-include-output-id-and-config",Studio slide serialization MUST include outputId and generationConfig,studio slide 序列化结果 MUST 返回 outputId 与 generationConfig 字段（camelCase wire）；前端读 outputId 做 slide→output 跳转、读 generationConfig 复用配置
  "studio-sse-done-payload-must-carry-trace-id",Studio SSE done event MUST carry traceId and slideId (not full slide),"studio SSE 的 done 事件 payload MUST 为 {traceId, slideId}（camelCase），MUST NOT 直接序列化整个 slide；且所有 SSE 事件 SHALL 携带 traceId 以支持关联/可观测性；outline/markdown 各生成阶段前 SHALL 发 toolcall 事件（对齐既有语义）"
  "studio-generation-config-must-expand-to-ranges",Studio generation MUST interpret generationConfig with concrete ranges not raw tokens,"studio outline 与 markdown 生成 MUST 解读 slide.generationConfig 的 quantity/density/audience/tone/structure/language/themePreset 字段并展开为具体区间与本地化提示；quantity/density 的区间映射与 preference（quality/speed）对检索参数（topK/minScore）的调节 MUST 可配置（默认对齐既有语义）。MUST NOT 把原始字段 id（如 'standard'）直接拼进 prompt 而不做展开。"
  "studio-frontmatter-six-key-shape","Studio frontmatter MUST use the six-key template shape with override support","studio 生成的 markdown frontmatter MUST 为 6-key 结构（theme 恒为 default、colorSchema、fonts{sans,serif,mono}、transition、background、class），对齐既有模板语义；当 generationConfig.frontmatter 非空时，MUST 以该字符串作为 frontmatter body 绕过预设，仅在缺 title: 且存在标题时补一行。MUST NOT 省略 colorSchema/class/serif/mono 字段。"
scenarios[18]{req_id,id,given,when,then,feature}:
  r53,"draft-centric-stages-are-recoverable","",用户在 input/outline/markdown 任一阶段中断并稍后返回,系统 SHALL 能从 draft 恢复到最近保存的阶段状态,true
  r111,"draft-endpoints-remain-stable","",客户端调用 draft CRUD 与保存端点,系统 SHALL 保持端点与字段语义稳定以避免客户端漂移,true
  r111,"draft-endpoints-fail-fast-when-slides-plugin-is-unavailable","",客户端在未安装/未启用/未选定 active slides workflow plugin 的情况下创建或生成 slides draft,系统 SHALL 返回稳定 errorCode / message / hint / details,true
  r148,"sse-emits-stable-event-set","",outline 或 markdown 通过 SSE 流式生成,系统 SHALL 仅使用 `progress/toolcall/done/busy/error` 事件集合并保持语义稳定,true
  r148,"client-requests-stream",客户端请求 outline/markdown stream 端点,生成进行中,系统 SHALL 通过 SSE 逐个发送 progress/toolcall/done/error 事件而非同步 JSON,true
  r183,"busy-requests-are-rejected-and-stale-is-cleared","",draft 处于 `running` 且用户再次发起生成,系统 SHALL 明确拒绝并发重复（busy 事件）；若检测到 stale running，则先清理再允许继续,true
  r183,"stale-no-error",slide 处 RUNNING 且已超过配置的 stale 阈值,系统清理 stale 状态,status=IDLE 且 errorMessage 为空（非诊断文案）,true
  r215,"markdown-requires-outline","",用户在未生成/保存 outline 的情况下请求 markdown stream,系统 SHALL 返回可读错误并结束连接,true
  r242,"draft-is-persisted-before-done","",生成成功并准备发送 `done`,系统 SHALL 先持久化 draft（含 chunkIds/stage/status）再发送 `done`,true
  r9,"preview-uses-latest-markdown","",用户触发预览刷新,系统 SHALL 先保存 markdown 再刷新当前 active plugin 声明的预览目标以确保一致性,true
  r9,"preview-uses-plugin-declared-renderer","",用户触发预览刷新且当前 active slides workflow plugin 已声明 preview contract,系统 SHALL 先保存 markdown,true
  r272,"slides-dialog-is-gated-by-tools-availability","",`/v2/workspace/tools` 未返回 `SLIDES`,客户端 SHALL 不把 slides 视为可直接打开的可用能力,true
  "studio-latest-draft","notebook-has-drafts",notebook 下存在多个 draft,客户端请求 drafts/latest,系统 SHALL 返回 updatedAt 最新的 draft,true
  "studio-serialize-must-include-output-id-and-config","read-output-id",前端读 slide.outputId 做 slide→output 跳转,系统返回 slide,序列化结果 SHALL 包含 outputId（含 null）与 generationConfig 字段,true
  "studio-sse-done-payload-must-carry-trace-id","sse-done-trace",SSE 流结束,系统发 done 事件,"done payload SHALL 为 {traceId, slideId}，所有事件 SHALL 带 traceId；阶段开始前有 toolcall 事件",true
  "studio-generation-config-must-expand-to-ranges","quantity-expands-to-range",a slide draft has generationConfig.quantity='detailed',the system builds the outline/markdown generation prompt,"the prompt MUST reference the concrete range from config (not the literal string 'detailed')",true
  "studio-generation-config-must-expand-to-ranges","preference-tunes-retrieval",a slide draft has generationConfig.preference='quality',the system retrieves context for generation,quality 配置的 topK/minScore 与 speed 不同（数值来自配置）,true
  "studio-frontmatter-six-key-shape","frontmatter-has-all-six-keys","a slide is generated with themePreset='minimal-clean'",the system writes the markdown frontmatter,"the frontmatter MUST contain theme: default, colorSchema, fonts (sans+serif+mono), transition, background, and class keys matching the preset template",true
